    "long_instructions": "## Exploring Spacing\r\n\r\nNotice that there is a new section of our webpage called `<style>`. This defines the rules for how the webpage should look.\r\n\r\nIn this level, we'll use AI Tutor to help us understand `padding` and `margin` and add spacing to our webpage.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1) Ask AI Tutor to explain the rules for these new CSS elements.\r\n    - You can send AI Tutor a message directly, or highlight the code and select \"Add to AI Tutor\"\r\n2) Ask AI Tutor to update the contact cards on the page. \r\n    - Use specific language, like \"`margin`\" or \"`padding` in px\", to make sure AI follows your vision.\r\n\r\n\r\nOnce you've added spacing to the contact cards: press the Continue button!",
