      "answerTypeCustomizations": {
        "buildCSS": "- ONLY add styles to the `<style>` tag in the head of the document. Follow the pattern already in the index.html file.\n- Do not use relative units for spacing; only use px.\n- Focus on the CSS tags emphasized in this level; do not add additional tags unless explicitly asked to.\n- Keep all explanations short, concise, and simple. Do not over-explain the changes you've made to the code.",
